{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PPTB :\u00a0 A Rogue-Lite Strategy Resource Management Game</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will harvest four distinct resource types using Pipetubes, and use these resources to obtain progressively advanced Pipetubes, building increasingly complex pipelines to overcome escalating resource challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Light Puzzle-Solving</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will deal with procedrually generated event puzzles, to trigger different storyline.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite Element</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will explore a procedurally generated world, with randomized Pipetube Cards and special efffect Stickers to create a unique experience for every new round of game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837210?t=1757916339","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837210?t=1757916339","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/8cc47718376dca424b9b297729c6ccc29a71c78e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757916339","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/8cc47718376dca424b9b297729c6ccc29a71c78e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757916339","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PPTB :\u00a0 A Rogue-Lite Strategy Resource Management Game</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will harvest four distinct resource types using Pipetubes, and use these resources to obtain progressively advanced Pipetubes, building increasingly complex pipelines